            "start_line": 29,
            "end_line": 30,
            "line_count": 2,
            "preview": "// Build the constant 12 as a DerivativeStructure (0 free variables, order 12) DerivativeStructure constantTwelve = new DerivativeStructure(0, 12, 12);"
